<title>PERU: Peru restructures $7.3 mln of debt with Belgium.</title>
<headline>Peru restructures $7.3 mln of debt with Belgium.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru's Economy Ministry on Tuesday said it signed a $7.3 million debt restructuring accord with Belgium as part of a series of agreements it has been negotiating with 14 creditor nations of the Paris Club.</p>
<p>&quot;The total amount that has been reprogrammed reaches 229 million Belgium francs ($7.3 million) and corresponds to concessional debt with the government of Belgium coming from contracts signed by both governments between 1975 and 1982,&quot; a ministry statement said.</p>
</text>
